    "feature_1": {
      "type": "mf35-stitch-feature",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_layout": "image_right",
        "kicker": "PATENTED MOBILITY FOLD HINGE",
        "title": "BIG-TRIKE STABILITY. COMPACT TRUNK FOOTPRINT.",
        "body": "<p>Traditional three-wheel trikes are notorious for being bulky garage-hogs that cannot be transported without dedicated pickup truck beds or trailer hitches. The Maxfoot MF-35 shatters this limitation with an aerospace forged alloy quick-fold mechanism.</p>",
        "image": "",
        "stat_1_value": "41.3\" × 31.5\"",
        "stat_1_label": "Folded overall dimensions",
        "stat_1_accent": false,
        "stat_2_value": "DUAL SAFETY",
        "stat_2_label": "Self-locking latch pin system",
        "stat_2_accent": false,
        "bullet_1": "Fits inside Honda CR-V, Toyota RAV4, Ford Explorer, and standard SUV hatchbacks.",
        "bullet_2": "Tuck it easily into condo elevators, hallway closets, or camper van storage bays.",
        "caption_label": "// REAL-WORLD PORTABILITY",
        "caption_body": "Fold and unfold in under 10 seconds without detaching wheels or wiring cables.",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 60
      }
    },
    "feature_2": {
      "type": "mf35-stitch-feature",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_layout": "image_left",
        "kicker": "ACCESSIBILITY FIRST GEOMETRY",
        "title": "EFFORTLESS 14.5\" MOUNTING. NO LEG SWINGING REQUIRED.",
        "body": "<p>Engineered specifically with ergonomic accessibility at the center. The ultra-low step-through standover clearance allows riders of any mobility level to step straight through the chassis without swinging a leg over a tall crossbar or dangerous saddle.</p>",
        "image": "",
        "stat_1_value": "14.5\"",
        "stat_1_label": "Standover",
        "stat_1_accent": false,
        "stat_2_value": "4'11\" — 6'2\"",
        "stat_2_label": "Min / Max Rider Height",
        "stat_2_accent": true,
        "bullet_1": "Combined with swept-back cruiser handlebars and an upright sitting posture, you preserve spinal alignment and eliminate wrist and shoulder joint fatigue.",
        "bullet_2": "Rider friendly design certified for all ages, physical rehabilitation, and leisure cruising.",
        "caption_label": "// ZERO HIP STRAIN",
        "caption_body": "Step straight through — no swinging leg over crossbar required.",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 60
      }
    },
    "feature_3": {
      "type": "mf35-stitch-feature",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_layout": "image_right",
        "kicker": "AUTOMOTIVE SAFETY ENGINEERING",
        "title": "AUTOMOTIVE DIFFERENTIAL AXLE. SMOOTH CORNERING WITHOUT TIPPING.",
        "body": "<p>Cheap direct-drive trikes force both rear wheels to spin at identical speeds, resulting in tire scrub, jerking turns, and dangerous roll risks. The MF-35 integrates a precision rear differential that automatically divides power, allowing the outer wheel to spin faster through sharp curves.</p>",
        "image": "",
        "stat_1_value": "3×",
        "stat_1_label": "Mechanical Disc Brakes",
        "stat_1_accent": false,
        "stat_2_value": "160mm",
        "stat_2_label": "Front + Dual Rear Rotors",
        "stat_2_accent": false,
        "bullet_1": "Triple Mechanical Disc Brake Calipers — 160mm front and dual rear rotor configuration stops 400 lbs smoothly under any wet or dusty road conditions.",
        "bullet_2": "Dual Integrated Parking Levers — Lock your trike instantly at the brake levers when loading heavy groceries or parking on a 15-degree driveway incline.",
        "caption_label": "",
        "caption_body": "",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 60
      }
    },
