    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_assembly": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much assembly is required out of the shipping crate?",
            "answer": "<p>The Maxfoot MF-35 arrives approximately <strong>85% pre-assembled</strong>. You simply unfold the main chassis latch, slide in the front handlebar stem, attach the front wheel with the quick-release skewer, install the pedals, and clip on the rear cargo basket. Complete technical tools, a multi-wrench, and step-by-step video tutorials are included in the box. Average unboxing to ride time is 20-30 minutes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_battery": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I charge the lithium battery off the bike?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! The 48V battery locks into place with an included anti-theft key. You can charge it directly while mounted to the frame, or unlock and remove it to charge inside your home, apartment, or office using any standard 110V household AC wall outlet.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_trial": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does the 14-Day At-Home Trial Policy work?",
            "answer": "<p>From the delivery date shown on tracking, you have 14 full days to test-ride your MF-35 in your own neighborhood (up to 10 miles of usage). If you are not completely thrilled with the comfort, stability, and build quality, simply contact our California customer service team to arrange a return.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_legal": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the MF-35 street legal in bike lanes without a license?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The MF-35 is certified as a Class 2 electric bicycle under US Federal law (CPSC regulations) with a maximum motor-assisted speed capped at 20 MPH. It requires no driver's license, no DMV vehicle registration, and no compulsory insurance to operate in bike lanes and neighborhood streets across all 50 states.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_warranty": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What does the 2-Year Maxfoot Factory Warranty cover?",
            "answer": "<p>Our comprehensive warranty covers all major core powertrain elements including the structural aluminum chassis, folding joint, Bafang electric hub motor, lithium battery pack, LED display controller, throttle, and wiring harness against manufacturer defects for a full 24 months. Replacement parts ship promptly from our Ontario, California fulfillment center.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
